  "_note": "INTERNAL. Authored position-for-position from the manufacturer's ETS 73 double-leaf cable diagram sheet: positions 1–15 with 3.1, 12.1 and 13.1. GF is the active leaf, SF the passive leaf; the active-leaf drive is the master, the passive-leaf drive the slave. Anchor routes are hand-authored — parallel risers and shared lanes read far better on a technical drawing than a generic router.",

  "components": [
